    <item>
      <title>[부음] 백분수 별세 외</title>
      <link>https://www.chosun.com/national/obituary-personnel/2026/10/14/J4DTIDXB6JDHRLQN577V6TB3MU/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.chosun.com/national/obituary-personnel/2026/10/14/J4DTIDXB6JDHRLQN577V6TB3MU/</guid>
      <dc:creator>김진영 기자</dc:creator>
      <description/>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:38:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <content:encoded>▲&lt;b&gt;백분수 &lt;/b&gt;별세, &lt;b&gt;나동연&lt;/b&gt; 경남 양산시장 모친상= 12일21시30분 경남 양산농협장례식장, 발인 15일10시, (055)366-4440&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;▲&lt;b&gt;봉병호&lt;/b&gt; 별세, &lt;b&gt;봉기녕&lt;/b&gt; 전자신문 영업마케팅국 회원영업팀 부국장·&lt;b&gt;봉은영&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;봉검녕&lt;/b&gt; 부친상, &lt;b&gt;고동섭&lt;/b&gt; 장인상, &lt;b&gt;명성숙&lt;/b&gt; 경기도의원 시부상=13일0시3분 경기 부천장례식장, 발인 15일7시, (032)651-0444&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;▲&lt;b&gt;윤주열&lt;/b&gt; 별세, &lt;b&gt;박문학&lt;/b&gt; 남편상, &lt;b&gt;윤희영&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;윤미선&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;윤수영&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;윤은민 &lt;/b&gt;부친상, &lt;b&gt;강부환&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;최원석 &lt;/b&gt;서울 구로구 부구청장·&lt;b&gt;이흥수 &lt;/b&gt;장인상=12일13시26분 서울아산병원, 발인 14일11시, (02)3010-2000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;▲&lt;b&gt;최두진&lt;/b&gt; 별세, &lt;b&gt;신정대&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;신정기&lt;/b&gt; 세성세무법인 대표 세무사·&lt;b&gt;신정헌&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;신순옥&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;신정만&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;신춘옥&lt;/b&gt;·&lt;b&gt;신순복 &lt;/b&gt;모친상=12일18시35분 강원 강릉아산병원, 발인 15일10시30분, (033)610-3895&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</content:encoded>
    </item>
